# Real values this project allows, read by scripts/check_personal_details.py.
# See CONTRIBUTING.md, "Personal details".
#
# Commit identities are not listed here: any author or committer passes when
# its email is anonymized, such as a GitHub noreply address
# (<id>+<login>@users.noreply.github.com). GitHub noreply addresses may also
# appear in files.
#
# text: value
#   Another real value that may appear in files, such as an upstream author's
#   published credit in a license or package manifest.
#
# account: name
#   A made-up account name used in example home folder paths, such as
#   /home/<name>. Common placeholders (alice, bob, me, exampleuser, YOUR_USER)
#   are already allowed.
